  lines:
  - speaker: 1
    text: "Do you want to know something very funny? I stole this pendant from her
      one night when she dozed off! Since then, she doesn\u2019t even remember her
      own daughter\u2019s face anymore!"
  - speaker: 0
    text: How could you do that to yourself? And why?!
  - speaker: 1
    text: Oh you know, I ended up getting bored and I found it funny. And then it
      was so shiny that it made me want to!
